-- ============================================================================
-- EC9 ASSOCIATE DEEP SEED: Joint Ventures, Operating Agreements & Cost
-- Recovery, beginner tier.
--
-- Six modules, 26 lessons, 132 questions (15 per module bank plus a 42
-- question final exam). The structure row is GENERATED from the tier's
-- manifest.json rather than hand typed, and the question rows from the
-- committed bank JSONs under tools/course-banks/joa/beginner.
--
-- What this tier owns: INTERESTS AND THE JOINT ACCOUNT. What a joint operating
-- agreement fixes; the texts with their editions and read dates; participating
-- interests and the partner split; paying and beneficial interests under a
-- carry; monthly cash calls, actuals, the difference, the threshold and
-- billing in arrears; budget control against the item and budget tolerances;
-- operator overhead on a marginal scale with exclusions.
--
-- AN ENGINE COURSE. There is no Suite app: the practicals run in the course's
-- own account calculator. The capstone grades six values of this tier, each
-- identical under every reading the engine states.
-- ============================================================================

values ('joa', 'beginner', '{"modules":[{"key":"m01-what-a-joint-operating-agreement-fixes","title":"What a Joint Operating Agreement Fixes","lesson_keys":["l01-a-licence-shared-by-agreement","l02-operator-non-operators-and-the-committee","l03-the-ekene-joint-venture","l04-sources-and-the-dates-they-were-read","l05-calculator-panels-and-refusals"]},{"key":"m02-participating-interests","title":"Participating Interests","lesson_keys":["l01-the-participating-interest","l02-interests-that-sum-to-the-whole","l03-cost-shares-and-production-shares","l04-the-partner-split"]},{"key":"m03-paying-and-beneficial-interests","title":"Paying and Beneficial Interests","lesson_keys":["l01-beneficial-interest-is-the-production-share","l02-paying-interest-under-a-carry","l03-carriers-pro-rata-and-in-stated-shares","l04-reading-the-interests-table"]},{"key":"m04-cash-calls","title":"Cash Calls","lesson_keys":["l01-the-joint-account-and-monthly-advances","l02-the-forecast-share","l03-actuals-and-the-difference","l04-the-no-call-threshold-and-arrears","l05-a-zero-call-month"]},{"key":"m05-budget-control","title":"Budget Control","lesson_keys":["l01-the-approved-budget-by-line","l02-the-item-tolerance","l03-the-budget-tolerance","l04-unbudgeted-items-and-the-allowance"]},{"key":"m06-overhead-basics","title":"Overhead Basics","lesson_keys":["l01-operator-overhead-and-its-base","l02-a-marginal-sliding-scale","l03-exclusions-and-the-band-edge","l04-the-capstone-brief"]}]}'::jsonb, 1)
